{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1429,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5431c81f2eee0fa16510e0b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢华丽的歌曲，\r\n就像蝶群翩翩起舞那样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94848e611e944870de07a9fa1cd6d3c541e8c13ed61a34a1418d455c35c70157",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3d8c51e305cf165ed9f49c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，总共有几朵樱花呢？\r\n请来找找看吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "acf85490e9a14ef79b15ac9bfe1351885e664dc3ed163a60edc878a6441cf89e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:357692e292ab14e34fc7b027",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服的设计很出色对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ce6117f85a4e192ae502d5e87d7759669a6e868fcac0b7c7b0a78906992b13b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c3117523cd2e6c816d1c400",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喜爱的服装又要变多了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ef7b378ba7069e2b8dceabe6b294bdb87f48f78701b1c4446aac221ad5f2fb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40a88f1f31173a1e84226eba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7353978df273aaabd070bbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "预备～一起喊！胜利～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb9a2cd4da88854a7241f2e63619c746374853c1ca6f7fa1fbd9ae948435b867",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "8007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:285cfaac8d33d871fd2f71f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！\r\n今天也要尽全力做好\r\n今天所能做到的事哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0f7d9fec847b00ecb21d7b42c23c5e54681c594e89831557fddfc55104e4b79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:829974c8d848368752906941",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的早餐是爸爸亲传，\r\n从法国学来的奥姆蛋！\r\n美味又充满营养。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4718d2b7d35ed52dfec4f555d70ff988f8ba155528257b91101f5aa6325bacac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c31beee14a4869917d193004",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还在胜利俱乐部的时候，\r\n我也会替每个人做好中午的便当，\r\n再带过去呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cde6c3d3f95226f33c4fa31592b0f077380ed2d9a26032b57a291044264e3d87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3e7bb0a073e9f7e62cd73b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "简单来说，食堂的推荐菜色\r\n就是色拉！健康又美味，\r\n让人忍不住一口接一口！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b602065b32e0975a07b6c14b67f04bd359aa46f555bb143c22aa389c3995538f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10a634756b17e74dca1b627b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～要买新的还是重打呢……\r\n啊，我是在说蹄铁！因为我都会\r\n在睡前配合状态进行维护。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89afa6445157aea1b0237aba18b44b5bb3190cd8c88549c9a02ae0e5e2414fcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe2fce49ac81d752ec524f76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明白自己的极限在哪里，\r\n可是非常重要的一件事呢。\r\n意思就是……绝不能逞强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e5a7bb86dfd577289c57c72b782826c44c3ad31ef6f25030cf0e2723936fe3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65b86e63ab9b6813f4c035d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年的樱花也开花了。\r\n挺过了漫长的冬天，凛然绽放……\r\n嗯，这果然是我最爱的花！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f09df8200e6511dbbe524bb3682f40948fff26eb1a0470aeaf080e02543e695e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd58b3bd9ecf083b553c4016",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天是个会让人期待泳池训练的\r\n季节呢！而且对脚的负担也不大，\r\n真是一箭双鵰♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "469c087a90731fc19017c7a9ceb02f2ce0526c8ae4e925035b40580559843703",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba0f511d83658e114d83e8ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸寄了法国的香菇来给我！\r\n要拿来煸炒吗？但是下点工夫\r\n做成浓汤也很不错呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2f9cdeefde1312c4d5aed9726b76a845da1bcdb95f73be575a53e29176a9c99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bb4a770fa69fa7d8bccc8b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肌肉如果没做好热身，\r\n会成为受伤的原因……对吧？\r\n所以我要去稍微练跑一下啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9fb709c45c01e3b5f38585b273608082c5c682a20d3fe036fcc8fe0d651c461",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33e6affb53977507c0e394db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01241030a2958216d802b541",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利俱乐部是我的原点！\r\n不管在难过还是懊悔的时候，\r\n这里都能让我积极地放眼梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee58be8e6e4563281bc75422fb17ce767642068fe88128b3a52665c4d1f5d172",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1597edb6df4c2013c668926",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我受父母的影响开始做法式料理……\r\n虽然还没办法做出全餐，\r\n但对咸派跟火上锅还是很有自信！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14f31be0e41b7338138dc9ef737234a5af9c2f19992c2ebd432a9fddc3e4f4ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fe35ecba815ac8d79338b64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小仁的比赛我全都有录像哦！\r\n虽然之前有一次被她本人发现，\r\n差点被逼着处理掉就是了……耶嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3350a7ecf4af8da948a2bda8b641e97d404f1dcb7ce7980ca1ae80fcd92a20b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ea8fe13a38810c43d8ac5fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对缠绕绷带的方法很有自信哦。\r\n因为缠上松开了无数次，\r\n便相对地越来越得心应手了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d389746727ff6690f04bbdb5c885951abf0c8b3a2d4d3b2447abd171cd9d521",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f88346973a8c3976fbe3438c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有点怕游乐园的尖叫类设施……\r\n跟飞机起飞时，\r\n五脏六腑浮荡的那种感觉很像。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5640350dde5fd6eb789508ffe295c7cc20500fef51bc87b722bb365b4e8760c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26456752567028dd5c3f85e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一穿上跟大家同款的服装，就会\r\n深刻感受到我终于站上了这里……\r\n站上同一个舞台！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b287f40e27a36663bf64e5945e6b35eeae77a2ae888d74a80c787b52e3f7baf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e06ab97b40c325aa8f6bd892",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不觉得颜色很可爱吗？像是由红、\r\n白、蓝组成的三色旗……咦？这是\r\n紫色……？这、这么一说还真的是！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f276f904d8ca7ea1fe6e347719a60faef37433e4bd710e40fdf512b34182c882",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42ff12da5389be5ef77014e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "月桂冠是胜利的象征。\r\n我想摘下不辱这顶冠冕……\r\n不辱此名的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b0ae33f8f42285e602a9d3934619af935eb19e2233bf492ddde983eb606c411",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91f0accfbda39f1b960c9393",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟胜利俱乐部的大家\r\n同款的服装……不只可爱，\r\n还是热血又坚强的樱花色！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa3843a1061f6ad401208d56bb20be7ea287b594f84dd7583923fb72c1854a2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f1c1f29450fbc19f63d2ba2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感到难过时就看看旭日吧！\r\n不管发生什么事，早晨都必会到来。\r\n这是件理所当然却又伟大的事呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8d78cf4e020a32c20aca3db9e788821f087f36224e0ab5894e11336d84a55cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0bda54e0640e6ab474ec0fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要跟小重一起喝下午茶，最后\r\n大概都会变成在聊小仁的话题呢。\r\n真是不可思议！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce34c15931c9e359714726bdd2fe9f1529be93b6d12f8fc4a28cb403a52f668c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85a647dced4e45dcfc2f89df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我最近很热衷躲在被窝看法文书……\r\n但很容易就不小心睡着，\r\n这或许是比较伤脑筋的地方？",
      "source_fingerprint": "db745a9af2c8e35c404b4635b629326ea9d0d3e413dc3a3053e03edfda23c194",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:485f9d167d3b67bc555f231e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花朵坚忍撑过冬天后绽放的季节……\r\n嗯，春天果然很美好呢。\r\n我最爱的樱花也会在此时盛开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3560b7baafcf0b381e4e1ee6ad574d2436f26eeef516a3866018744ac4978a5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7a822cdc53e66822eb04a7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有什么推荐的防晒乳吗？\r\n最近小空去钓鱼回来后，\r\n脖子后面常常都红通通的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f7163871c6674be781e0db7e3c58e83b25b876a42f96f574e86bfc52f4b40cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8760b4d43270adde542a706",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽快换衣服，还要立刻拿出毛毯。\r\n呵呵，这些都是在\r\n换季时不会感冒的秘诀喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d276e4f331ec86a696218f12f3fec5750cd101d57c9c2b7b095dc4f136b6e02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa6f65ef3fd71b365d70813c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天好玩的活动太多了……\r\n得注意不要玩得太过头，\r\n像小时候一样发烧了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91b65516d94d1a74822762a458d0862b70f225f5bea063b15280fa42da1bfabb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e71574a0352d2dce8baa85f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "确实做好现在能做的事！\r\n积极地努力完成吧！\r\n跟我一起喊～胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dba64bae6cf7a97632cf0e55fdf830af77a7d6f33cb20c1595400956b03add68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0904332784cc270b73426be0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よしっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30e28360c52fb9c3f6b9a96c8e4ece7924de57f6ba6cc2f1e53636e02353838c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:511b37961d3554ca12576c0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也让我们去细细品味\r\n能够进行训练的幸福吧。\r\n──呵呵，真是开心呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2b7a3a0d7157ffa6d623df654bd914f0ff2da0396040a98368e99479afde116",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee957b0d08199d7ac5e4e693",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蹄铁的状态也万无一失。\r\n因为我在训练前，\r\n已经好好调整过了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "060fb0ade1b96ac8f40aee835c1de912273c5884c2794bc7b30439a0c1cfbf40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77d881aa5a901e7f3d161223",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「只要持续磨萝卜就会变萝卜泥」，\r\n所以今天也要爆进！\r\n……开玩笑的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e9d5b60104e0d815ad1cc4ed023867eac346e45cf9a748f67b825492f15002c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ada1d8579260f7a0fcc84fec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的努力与训练员的努力所一同\r\n孕育出的那份无法取代的活力，\r\n盈满了我的内心♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d89b7faca7a86a876f2749f7f10fa4f6c368b3e7956d92753a44077852f4034c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f169bbad01583660594b0171",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一边倒了有另一边撑着。\r\n因为相信我们永远都会互相扶持……\r\n我才能尽情地奔跑喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e64ff77a475d7a6a464ed3486ad6b68f4999c01802bd39c780650414494e9235",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3aa676d7d70de8ec9530162d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别担心，我绝对会盛开。\r\n因为我是你所栽培\r\n出来的花蕾！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddcbc6bdecf85c417a9f564b184b969dca544d7256863c7443c04e6a97aac8db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:709cceb80fa76314c87eb16c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多么充满活力的蔚蓝啊……！\r\n呵呵，让人心旷神怡呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27b8b14f2b913befb3749e6b0af6151b010e5888a2e9f385e4a62f93f493b927",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b28821f7a942cb8bb1273ed1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是超乎预期的完美结局！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c05ef116c41537395c9df1aa3ed485b61b38fee3fd5c7b20fb33e384b575ee5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acde8d2b29ce0b322ea1168a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不会凋零的樱花盛开了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9982b7f81dd8b464ed7ae5425d8df65ff0ae1de702e7ffc170e3c2854740268",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaf92ff636b8a0de21508bb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跌倒了多少次，就能往前走得多远！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbc6d368421fd13a99df7688320bb6c9618bced7f878c19d2fe2566c215316b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac564f0f72eb715f1895ac54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比那天看到的光芒还要强烈……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "212bbecc99b1a66dd91145b6745db35d800881126fd4f1bfe55d43de0efb9fe8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcf68ea99e10de43d9cb1a5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不哭泣不气馁不放弃！\r\n我是樱花桂冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dee687c7c128f3722e20f8da61bcfea9dd73a7712bc04e9279d4fc437ccc4c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc2d6d9f24d9ba3b653102fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "站起身来，向前迈进。\r\n等到总有一天──会鲜艳盛开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bba1e8da5c6fcd5782c6d93f29957b4b902d9908ef291a42984f36b7c9ea4e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d36559ad936076f70278b8ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会努力帮忙♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f99d06fcc7282dcbb90cd4f8bf3f265134e6573df34eb04a96e5544b2f404dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41bf050fab8aa051335ce4ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全都包在我身上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "908a0c8ee291fa6589e827f920b7623758438efd95db6e002a69aa3b79fa3703",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df9b322aefaa9cbb07075cca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们赢了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c73d227f90117b854c4244c6cdd5a136dfb0ffdbdb0439ab2bf7dd9ffde2159",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c848cfa651d58178ef2211c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员选中了我\r\n还对我充满期待…这份恩情\r\n我想用我的奔跑来回报！",
      "source_fingerprint": "236c0ff062bceb09a7f8df579e8208516d8c154728d3ac1291fa9a62665b5e03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7601fe57d5025203094a5cce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e6c34d6deac81a93e6a4bc4c01159e343249a9b49665c4350b63afde671cd7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2be6b320a33ac51c790d37b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま戻りました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f8b04b4edb572764b45e483a28cd1cf6e40442b258dd629e84cb2d8e5633947",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:512e5d2a3797b7e100dc8a86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在思考的事情，\r\n真的很简单…\r\n就是如何回应训练员的期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2c37d2a8d1f116f33e9f83a70af2492acddcbedec3861ef8bcd0601efcc73ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35794b48e8295eff2f4c6c1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一个人的力量不如两个人…\r\n这件事也许是理所当然的,但是\r\n有训练员在就有超过一百个人的力量了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ecd1ae37413ca5170a148f2803dfe692fb42dac2890299ac00e796f68624e3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6710da4baaa4b26bfaea4ef4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！\r\n一起去看新年日出吧\r\n顺便还可以开始新年的第一次跑步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a16cf126d33af261fbfce3746486aacc3b73c9f3f8c90fecb8007c34a865fc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30e958411cac0ded0487eeba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是给训练员您的巧克力，\r\n都是我自己做的！\r\n觉得疲劳的时候请吃点，让自己充满活力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cbc1c2b1d0359f65da504230f4ab6c56994ff5389dc8e82ff3f3d4c0f0a00d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d0b785019b8b4693c1c1175",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年做的巧克力无论是做法还是材料\r\n都非常非常有讲究！\r\n感觉…应该会很好吃！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14563e5b560a68f3512a638936b1e5fa424c26f99682b57c29657f9f44ae597b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2877b652f79447caa758906",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕啊…我的愿望是\r\n能够成为能实现大家愿望的自己…\r\n呃，总感觉有点麻烦呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea8b22edc80d03b1b4b3446bb7acd2fafd78f06b721637d7e85b57a382c2df1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3e3dc721e015f71ede65602",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年万圣节豁出去了！\r\n机会难得\r\n我想让大家都能带些漂亮的点心回去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecbe9ab7b20263ef452630a569b02af3caed4669692af27b399c753c260c08e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07f00d355bf8cfa4b8b0d5ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给大家送上各自喜欢的礼物…\r\n圣诞老人这份工作还真是不错呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "908fdcf6cbbdaa7f8b8f4ade9a856adb73c67708ccaa5220bd7697e3137a05a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b3e63f12a50936a1689a54c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然一般来说圣诞节都是和家里人一起过\r\n但是和训练员一起过…好像\r\n也没有什么违和感！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f8b54616f089b96abdd414ec87194087fc3cd03984f0e422c29991bffd58500",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:965a763fcac67783225d6e03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干得好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "374effcca156d5c76fbf70dbcdc2ce990867ab5653ec236aced822aa0eb9a66f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20792f6c0c0835dae2d67320",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然很想说来年也请继续努力，\r\n…但是现在要说的是，今年一整年！\r\n真的非常非常感谢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15334c78f0f4116bd82ec49edda17274f7af01b92313bbbe81768dfdee1cff56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70290ab53233084ecbf4d028",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐！\r\n为了训练员这一年能有成果\r\n我会努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a2cc874cecea9566ddcc1a5678ae5f0685b968e954f9e4c313a2aa7211167f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0b1eeb14e222b10930e42a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…啊，那个？祝贺的文章，\r\n我想了很久…唔唔唔…\r\n总之！生日快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fced72ad2adb2a7493d491d98ffda6d36f62993305466f5319c3e8d7f5a2d237",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba56c2e3039bdaab6ca1e269",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想做什么来陪我庆祝生日…\r\n嗯~么…啊！那么，可以\r\n陪我一起踢足球吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f8f3cb01802113094948a86e7a1e5fb1aa5488b6735e74b151d110965076e7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93885be00202265070f15b34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有了训练员的祝福，\r\n我觉得在新的一年里…我要\r\n更加更加努力才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dc5d4e9916855b14eae6db59612760cf87111e58d8a45d60795579bbd07e2ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ea3ae6e1ecc41e3b0821cc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有通知来了！\r\n要一起确认一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fd33d4dde3231cc8d55670c027687149ebfc493005209f42703581ea504fbea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe3673b72bd7bb2f44c66ce6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物送过来了！\r\n需要我帮忙搬一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "06c1a7408e0f679da24421a8b85448c8ba9e309e664a27b46d1d8c68bb8f05ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c4a48f2eb13805292cad3b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务好像完成了！\r\n您辛苦了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c58434e4a27f99dcc9e925afd97749eb7f06442999b1125efa49a42d73629701",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf8689f0338f4479f36411e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动好像开始了！\r\n我…会拼命努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5168ce797cf7f4b690afc6df1e7af7a0a67de09d09cc1514edffb7e769f85f4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e65bfe3a52574ce2e328178",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在进行呢！\r\n准备就绪，随时可以开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b0bab3aa078f0cbde1b06cfb38f92b41af7a13506a88ef82f9af18ad5d32632",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a03f5df4e1215ac08f21fd69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好可惜…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af14f4cd3010da9d19ed1f3d3a01b67d6deeee033263ef51b16e6260a485520f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b437b93010d311c76c869ace",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n好像已经提高了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b9a111e3470a20105bfec2d55fb7a1e2a6dcbedd2056f91679596f7345593ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c65eef6b73cdcae0774c6e42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やっぱり私は走りやすい短パン派\r\nです！…って、ウマ娘だと同じこと\r\n考えてる子ばかりかもですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15eea95006a0de742e9d9d1947b26c0be375fcd72a9330483f00f21b10fdd419",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc9fd1c50a0c2758424b1328",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "友だちと試着して\r\n見せ合ったりしながら決めた、\r\n思い出のあるコーデなんです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1204bcbe85683f0d8596373d97990f35565c1ff326434a6980895059b2c32f31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c53ddab04b3545558d87c2fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走っていて帽子が飛んでいきそうに\r\nなることもありますが…そんな時は\r\n耳をぴとっとして押さえるんです！",
      "source_fingerprint": "343635bfec6c77f3d677be4cd2e604eb9c598b7dcafbba4581ea821bd524f04b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28615af107d838a75d919586",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对手也很厉害呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3b316da43bbca5f15a4088eb8e3d96c42188d1231c33ba5f70ff3077962edee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "1003"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
